{"4603250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "One Dumb Wizard", "steam_appid": 4603250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Its not about the money, it's about the principle.&quot; - The Wizard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;One Dumb Wizard&quot; is a 2D Action Rogue-like where you take on the role of The Wizard on their reckless mission to get their money back from The Bartender.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras/7a2d3710efea4d46daef283a15bc96a5.avif?t=1781847979\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras_big/7a2d3710efea4d46daef283a15bc96a5.avif?t=1781847979 width=1560 height=580 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wand and sling spells to gain the upper hand as you fight through hordes of the Bartender's goons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras/869dd49e33bb441e0307f36398d1f550.avif?t=1781847979\" width=1500 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft new wands and change how you play!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you might find curious gems (wand cores) and unique types of wood. These aren't just cosmetic! Use them to craft new wands that use entirely different play styles and attacks. Constantly mix and match cores and wood types to keep your advantage and adapt on the fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras/481fdf1e368b4c29d8e0c8b313b20c26.avif?t=1781847979\" width=1280 height=550 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add some charm to your run!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to crafting new wands, you'll also find various handy charms that you can attach to your wand. Each charm is unique and offers powerful boosts. Some charms even have different effects depending on the type of wand they're attached to! And don't worry, all your charms stay with you as you jump from wand to wand, so collect as many as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dozens of charms available to loot (and many more to come!), there's no end to the number of ways you can add some charm to each run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras/1b1ec42e2dce6292566255e9aeec8cc1.avif?t=1781847979\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and master spells on the journey to your money!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While lacking in pure destructive power, strategic use of spells might be the ticket to save yourself from perishing. Whether that be erecting walls to isolate a fight, summoning powerful gusts of wind to knock back enemies, or quickly blinking out of danger, a true wizard can always use their tools to stay one step ahead! Besides, what is a wizard without their spells?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras/d087ebdb07253edc39a43572c4dfa99c.avif?t=1781847979\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras_big/d087ebdb07253edc39a43572c4dfa99c.avif?t=1781847979 width=1560 height=922 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try, try and try again...and then maybe try some more.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, &quot;One Dumb Wizard&quot; will constantly be updated with new content in the form of new enemies, wands, charms, spells and many more ways to customize your load out each run as well as fleshing out the story. Join the community to help shape the future of the game!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Its not about the money, it's about the principle.&quot; - The Wizard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;One Dumb Wizard&quot; is a 2D Action Rogue-like where you take on the role of The Wizard on their reckless mission to get their money back from The Bartender.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras/7a2d3710efea4d46daef283a15bc96a5.avif?t=1781847979\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras_big/7a2d3710efea4d46daef283a15bc96a5.avif?t=1781847979 width=1560 height=580 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wand and sling spells to gain the upper hand as you fight through hordes of the Bartender's goons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras/869dd49e33bb441e0307f36398d1f550.avif?t=1781847979\" width=1500 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft new wands and change how you play!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you might find curious gems (wand cores) and unique types of wood. These aren't just cosmetic! Use them to craft new wands that use entirely different play styles and attacks. Constantly mix and match cores and wood types to keep your advantage and adapt on the fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras/481fdf1e368b4c29d8e0c8b313b20c26.avif?t=1781847979\" width=1280 height=550 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add some charm to your run!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to crafting new wands, you'll also find various handy charms that you can attach to your wand. Each charm is unique and offers powerful boosts. Some charms even have different effects depending on the type of wand they're attached to! And don't worry, all your charms stay with you as you jump from wand to wand, so collect as many as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dozens of charms available to loot (and many more to come!), there's no end to the number of ways you can add some charm to each run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras/1b1ec42e2dce6292566255e9aeec8cc1.avif?t=1781847979\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and master spells on the journey to your money!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While lacking in pure destructive power, strategic use of spells might be the ticket to save yourself from perishing. Whether that be erecting walls to isolate a fight, summoning powerful gusts of wind to knock back enemies, or quickly blinking out of danger, a true wizard can always use their tools to stay one step ahead! Besides, what is a wizard without their spells?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras/d087ebdb07253edc39a43572c4dfa99c.avif?t=1781847979\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/extras_big/d087ebdb07253edc39a43572c4dfa99c.avif?t=1781847979 width=1560 height=922 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try, try and try again...and then maybe try some more.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, &quot;One Dumb Wizard&quot; will constantly be updated with new content in the form of new enemies, wands, charms, spells and many more ways to customize your load out each run as well as fleshing out the story. Join the community to help shape the future of the game!</p>", "short_description": "One Dumb Wizard is an action roguelike where you play as a wizard hell-bent on getting their money back from the Bartender. Find charms to power up your wand, parts to craft new wands, and strategically sling spells in your singular mission to GET YOUR MONEY BACK.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/6fa1ca4e22be64dc2d8fe24117a9db52146d99ce/header.jpg?t=1781847979", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/148d24530ddebd27c1db89133e36d7ffd00d1e66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781847979", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603250/148d24530ddebd27c1db89133e36d7ffd00d1e66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781847979", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics with full Vulkan 1.2 support</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</str